            <div xml:id="m-4b9d64c9-538d-4105-8f0a-52fbab1e75a6">
              <lg xml:id="m-e98bef3c-1272-4265-ac44-519aeb33bd98">
                <l xml:id="m-665a30b5-98b2-44e2-a0ea-cfc18e834a77" facs="#m-b8e52133-22eb-4339-b4d0-7916cfbcd700" label="ambiguous">sse</l><l xml:id="m-841cc3b3-d870-47e1-971d-8aa34b62b25c" facs="#m-6e1db447-c325-4da8-93ed-163f6c39312b" label="text-like">Sunday within the Octave of the Ascension.</l><l xml:id="m-721de9ea-958e-4503-9e47-0371baf139dc" facs="#m-49806fc1-7673-4d99-8889-4d000d1fbdad" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-8be1222d-d024-42e0-93e0-dbcbabb94725" facs="#m-ae981aef-efab-4991-9e24-6b72954038d3" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-b06b5250-a7e5-4ed1-af89-044ca96feac3" facs="#m-490eddee-e612-461d-a95d-4f444c7092f9" label="lyrics-like">lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae0662ac-6882-4fec-92d8-ae6a7b2781b6" facs="#m-e083d2a6-298d-4df1-b29e-c4ab82a274c9" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-4fc9c06d-caa7-44aa-b2b2-0a6a17d6b066" facs="#m-97d1a0df-68b6-457e-a1a0-3b331a038b45" label="ambiguous">L- le¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5ec5ed1-3788-4fb4-8064-0c5af96eebae" facs="#m-b04bb583-31fe-405e-a330-304ed0b692ca" label="lyrics-like">V. Non vos re- lin- quam órpha¬</l><l xml:id="m-3fdc9743-b529-45dd-9742-a95cc08799bb" facs="#m-12befb90-5d11-408e-a14e-3b2e93cc5450" label="ambiguous">do,</l><l xml:id="m-ae3164e0-7a49-4b9d-b5d3-d6347403995c" facs="#m-0d40610c-fd9b-4cc7-8a1e-f834c6400273" label="lyrics-like">et vé-ni¬o</l><l xml:id="m-71a685c0-a346-4e5c-9064-2f81580e93de" facs="#m-e2eaec16-7394-4589-abc5-88666374c9c5" label="ambiguous">ad vos, et gau¬</l><l xml:id="m-a603b8f4-d5ee-4b3f-8d2f-6d34becaec66" facs="#m-7ddd8204-c957-41ea-9168-9619f4026e18" label="lyrics-like">nos : vá¬</l><l xml:id="m-634e5c95-e7c8-4477-b9a8-06842ea0de94" facs="#m-9b0c6684-8147-4e14-b26c-1132abaf2fbe" label="lyrics-like">dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5270ecc6-61a6-4516-9351-43bc40544b6b" facs="#m-3e7ffb7d-f913-46d0-a10b-7940e2a34426" label="ambiguous">bit</l><l xml:id="m-00a83814-e369-4e15-9df7-6b1c07727f5d" facs="#m-6e35aeee-36ac-4173-b271-a5b14ae57100" label="lyrics-like">vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e9f5148a-2a70-4655-8702-d6b76f86c413" facs="#m-6999a650-1be5-4a98-906e-2b81001899c3" label="ambiguous">*cor</l><l xml:id="m-a8e201f3-e90b-44b7-accb-97117062be16" facs="#m-a04760c8-3cff-4a93-8550-05b27542a604" label="ambiguous">strum.</l><l xml:id="m-9456ec93-2c0b-4767-bc93-043edded1864" facs="#m-0c6cafd8-e315-4ce1-8d23-1278bb06e46f" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Ioannem.</l><l xml:id="m-6973befa-bc3f-4ba8-9c2e-fa01ca1d54bd" facs="#m-adf9259a-e834-4c2b-ad54-c2af8ada7367" label="ambiguous">Joann. 15. d. et 1o.</l><l xml:id="m-cedfba28-35d2-4dd5-b82a-deb7f003da19" facs="#m-c6cfc569-f743-4901-9434-68e7f2e7a1c7" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore : Dixit Jesus di- gógis fácient vos: sed venit hora,</l><l xml:id="m-444723c0-fc47-44a9-a9e2-c4dc8362393c" facs="#m-c0673025-a6a0-412e-8840-3aa95bbad54b" label="lyrics-like">L scipulis suis: Cum vénerit Pará¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0b301c4-a80f-489d-8d20-09498e5bcad8" facs="#m-5b84b1b1-f883-4db4-bd5c-cb69d4cc3dce" label="lyrics-like">ut omnis qui intérficit vos. arbitré¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe347771-0b4d-46e6-93ad-6834c6f2dcc4" facs="#m-a58d4ddb-edc3-4600-80fa-a002b934b6a1" label="ambiguous">clitus, quem ego mittam vobis a</l><l xml:id="m-6619f2ee-410e-4441-9392-479bd72a3ce8" facs="#m-e939256c-c215-4f21-b441-39feb9897fb4" label="lyrics-like">tur obséquium se praestáre Deo. Et</l><l xml:id="m-c3f7a352-72e8-4a5b-ab75-a7470862e0b9" facs="#m-4152aed2-6466-49c1-ae01-fcf76474f477" label="lyrics-like">Patre, Spiritum veritátis, qui a Pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f0df654-b2e5-436f-b610-fee74e10b167" facs="#m-faa8ecf4-1451-4299-9a55-0bf76c32ff89" label="lyrics-like">haec fácient vobis, quia non nové¬</l><l xml:id="m-09c5925a-c674-421d-8152-20990b2b706e" facs="#m-71e571ac-235f-445e-8ddd-229c1fd328c8" label="lyrics-like">tre procédit, ille testimónium per¬</l><l xml:id="m-8db99325-336b-46b1-be82-35863848a201" facs="#m-738b38c4-2d09-4d15-a363-bcdd5f6f459a" label="ambiguous">runt Patrem, neque me. Sed haec</l><l xml:id="m-1d14c1fb-5ebd-4a42-8a6a-c1709417faed" facs="#m-64c5781d-d748-48e6-bbc6-79cfaf457e16" label="lyrics-like">hibébit de me: et vos testimónium</l><l xml:id="m-d326332b-b418-4368-b31a-2d10aae3431b" facs="#m-d3dca4f5-d89f-4e3f-afb7-a4de0b5e085b" label="lyrics-like">locútus sum vobis, ut, cum vénerit</l><l xml:id="m-49d0b37b-1386-400e-8e08-3ac6a21d2fcd" facs="#m-9b5a1692-49f4-4851-b99b-5773abc393ef" label="lyrics-like">perhibébitis, quia ab inítio mecum</l><l xml:id="m-966a3daa-62b7-4342-a055-ea2d9237eb0f" facs="#m-8417329d-e5bb-4be7-9fdf-96ce790ee11f" label="lyrics-like">hora eórum, reminiscámini, quia</l><l xml:id="m-d0a31013-b73f-45b1-8f64-ff352eb3bb82" facs="#m-c113db97-864f-4598-8ce4-a509828cf66c" label="lyrics-like">estis. Haec locútus sum vobis, ut</l><l xml:id="m-3ac63386-a2b1-4766-ad7d-17f5d9e9ef2f" facs="#m-80c46719-1021-4fd0-ad98-4b23a1e2aaf0" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-08ececca-f235-425a-a0fe-ff5c9c879965" facs="#m-78f74d5b-14c5-4419-8961-950605a9bebf" label="ambiguous">ego dixi vobis.</l><l xml:id="m-669aa070-f42f-4c8f-9a67-b5a4bdae7f67" facs="#m-915734c9-337a-4963-9d63-c2c533008d68" label="lyrics-like">non scandalizémini. Absque syna¬</l><l xml:id="m-282acaad-4470-4c5d-9d47-9c5587e311a0" facs="#m-48c7ceb6-63fb-409b-8ec1-f9dd4faca7f3" label="lyrics-like">offertory. Ascéndit. 849.</l><l xml:id="m-ec4653d8-796a-4239-982f-51c8220781dd" facs="#m-4bc19d43-1352-4a96-8862-533542cf6115" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-5d42e7b3-7907-4795-9876-331e3990444f" facs="#m-9f3060a6-7b45-483a-a3f7-f1fd5c7c4467" label="lyrics-like">(Acrificia nos, Dómine, immacu-] nostris supérnae grátiae dent vigó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6fbc330c-9173-4e78-8fe6-fe8cc9aef229" facs="#m-e3fb4adf-73c1-413e-af26-e88580f32be5" label="lyrics-like">D láta purificent: et méntibus rem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-13aae6c3-011d-4b6f-a9d2-8d01d687dd4b" facs="#m-6a168ace-fde8-41ed-b14d-78b51d94b2c7" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of the Octave or the Ascension.  Secret. Súscipe, Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-39898276-e34c-44b5-909e-457e8f2b2462" facs="#m-c260c685-28e9-4b36-b676-2eb6941b64e9" label="ambiguous">p. 810.</l><l xml:id="m-7fa3b5ae-ce62-4ce7-b07d-1742849682c4" facs="#m-38ff5e7d-677d-4487-bc49-1fc031bd733a" label="text-like">Preface of the Ascension, p. 9.</l><l xml:id="m-5c98d61c-c6b6-4d12-be7a-09f61717fa3d" facs="#m-877cd30b-3d25-4d19-bb6b-06da9d1c9cd9" label="ambiguous">comm.!</l><l xml:id="m-865316c1-28ce-4fdf-8b7d-227048520cec" facs="#m-71f6758b-cf26-44b5-99d4-d5b2ac059eab" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-ba55a025-1f86-47b3-8987-08f5b7170ccc" facs="#m-7b9bc38f-7644-41cf-b0c0-a7fbc8109179" label="lyrics-like">cum és-sem cum é¬</l><l xml:id="m-aa401848-dabc-44d8-b933-84ab9ffb3b6d" facs="#m-2826dcb4-1743-47ca-b7d1-eb989d25e455" label="text-like">is,</l><l xml:id="m-52e74829-bc80-49fb-b5ca-963b6755fcab" facs="#m-3969a306-c502-4ce2-aed6-e523115f50df" label="ambiguous">A-ter,</l><l xml:id="m-80e956ce-8e2b-4353-b100-5b688b1b79d2" facs="#m-524b59a6-a979-4324-aef7-3637611ae6fe" label="lyrics-like">égo</l><l xml:id="m-78abf2e6-446f-4065-9cc7-46c0c97436e3" facs="#m-33612df1-793c-49a1-acbc-26f75830146a" label="lyrics-like">servá¬</l><l xml:id="m-1181d9a5-121e-4aac-8412-67242f79a9e8" facs="#m-a3fe3e30-8828-4241-abc8-25d7d708c9bf" label="ambiguous">A</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>